          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-ps="src/components/reviews/ReviewsHero.astro:9wmew5">
            <a href="/book/" class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-white rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg transition-all no-underline" data-ps="src/components/reviews/ReviewsHero.astro:hav42">
              <span data-ps="src/components/reviews/ReviewsHero.astro:90qpch">Book a Visit</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10" />
